{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728540/extras/565ef3be7d7a4009cac68dadc652cbcb.poster.avif?t=1772514194\" width=618 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728540/extras/565ef3be7d7a4009cac68dadc652cbcb.webm?t=1772514194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728540/extras/565ef3be7d7a4009cac68dadc652cbcb.mp4?t=1772514194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The High Tower is a third-person, single-player action-adventure game that blends exploration, puzzle-solving, and intense combat, set in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland. After the collapse of civilization, Earth is enveloped in thick, toxic clouds. Humanity\u2019s only hope lies in a colossal tower reaching beyond the poisoned skies. As the divine Chosen, you are entrusted by the Church with a sacred mission\u2014to climb the tower, delve into its mysteries, and confront the truth buried in its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the biblical tale of the Tower of Babel, the game combines an epic end-times narrative with massive architectural aesthetics. As you rise through each layer of the megastructure, you'll face not only crumbling ruins and cryptic machinery but also remnants of a civilization that has lost its way. Your journey will test your wits, combat skills, and your very beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Exploration: Traverse through dense fog and forgotten ruins to uncover the secrets of a world consumed by catastrophe. The Tower is both mankind\u2019s last hope and its prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person Action Adventure: Experience the journey through an immersive third-person perspective, highlighting detailed character animations and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal Structure Aesthetics: Navigate towering monoliths and massive architectural marvels that emphasize scale, atmosphere, and existential awe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Storylines: Play as one of three uniquely motivated climbers. The Scientist seeks to unlock a dimensional gate at the summit. The Heretic aims to detonate a nuclear device and bring it all to an end. The Mercenary follows orders to eliminate threats lurking in the tower. Each path leads to different fates, shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith Meets Science: With inspiration drawn from the Tower of Babel, <i>Tower</i> weaves religious and sci-fi themes into a deeply philosophical narrative. It poses questions about destiny, ambition, and the limits of human understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Chosen, tasked with ascending the last monument of humanity. Are you ready to climb? Confront what lies above\u2014and what remains below.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Land of Ruins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3728540/1aaafe276dba195dbf5085ccc4e7036f1ee41deb.jpg"},{"name":"Statue of Liberty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3728540/dc5466aa56a110eab7fd8a056f4375c3993b0a06.jpg"},{"name":"Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3728540/44b62ab066f41a0fbbf19fbfb6297f8ae73afe1b.jpg"},{"name":"The Giant Statue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3728540/77ad1116f87337b4d89668320b904e34c1955fca.jpg"},{"name":"Pillar of the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3728540/fdefe0c4d41b88e8ad9d