><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal Structure Aesthetics: Navigate towering monoliths and massive architectural marvels that emphasize scale, atmosphere, and existential awe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Storylines: Play as one of three uniquely motivated climbers. The Scientist seeks to unlock a dimensional gate at the summit. The Heretic aims to detonate a nuclear device and bring it all to an end. The Mercenary follows orders to eliminate threats lurking in the tower. Each path leads to different fates, shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith Meets Science: With inspiration drawn from the Tower of Babel, <i>Tower</i> weaves religious and sci-fi themes into a deeply philosophical narrative. It poses questions about destiny, ambition, and the limits of human understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Chosen, tasked with ascending the last monument of humanity. Are you ready to climb? Confront what lies above\u2014and what remains below.</p>","developers":["ZHANG FAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728540/4e84ecc3265f86ea7659df5fa20b697f9e440529/header.jpg?t=1772514194","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 2060 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li